ares
====

No ares source file is included in this repository. The patches in
patches/ares/ quote and change lines of ares source files at commit
c76aaffa6e69778baf9a66d1da04298ac2ed7d1d
(https://github.com/ares-emulator/ares); they are distributed under the
ares licence below. tools/oracle/snes/aresref/aresref.cpp uses ares as a
library and contains no ares code. The SNES documents under docs/ cite
ares source files as one of several references, in their own words.

